  (text "3-PWM requires PWM_MODE = 10b; read back before RUN. Reset default is 6-PWM.\nDRVOFF high = all outputs Hi-Z. Low PWM alone is not shutdown.\nACT_DRIVE_EN wakes the driver; RUN stays low during SPI configuration."
    (at 166 40 0)
